# Runtime volumes — persistent app data on the Umbrel, never source.
# photos.db here holds the ENTIRE live schedule (workers / jobs / week_rows /
# assignments / day_flags), so on any machine that has actually run the app a
# stray `git add -A` would publish real business data to a public repo.
# The .gitkeep files stay tracked so the volume mount points survive a clone.
crosscuts/data/**
!crosscuts/data/**/
!crosscuts/data/**/.gitkeep

# Default runtime dirs when DB_DIR / UPLOADS_DIR / CONFIG_DIR are not set
# (local runs only; the container always sets them).
crosscuts/app/data/
crosscuts/app/uploads/
crosscuts/app/config/

# Local dev scratch (database, uploads, config for the node:sqlite shim).
.dev/

# Installed dependencies. package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored — the
# image build wants it committed.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Claude Code agent worktrees
.claude/
